      "writtenOn": "2021-01-18T17:07:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this logic should be replaced with a check that only uses the modules that are actually preferred. i.e. If prebuilts are preferred then this should ignore the source and if the source is preferred then this should ignore the prebuilt.\n\nThat is a little tricky to do as only the prebuilt modules know whether they or the source modules are preferred. So, the check cannot be done here but can only be done when duplicates are detected.",
      "revId": "720ed452346bc92bd82e3d3c1c6def453e1928d6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b0acfb88_cec1fe66",
        "filename": "java/boot_jars.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 75,
      "author": {
        "id": 1373864
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-18T17:55:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What I aimed for here is to be as close as possible to the same logic for selecting modules in a normal platform build, and I figured this condition would be close to that. E.g. module.Enabled() should be done in general to filter out modules that are disabled, because VisitAllModules doesn\u0027t do it.\n\nDoing something special to recognise prebuilt selection only means spreading out that special-case logic. What\u0027s the benefit of that?\n\nDo you know why IsHideFromMake filters out both modules in the TestPrebuiltExportDexImplementationJars test? If I know that I may understand better where you\u0027re coming from.\n\n\u003e only the prebuilt modules know whether they or the source modules are preferred.\n\nMore specific would be\n\n  module.Prebuilt().UsePrebuilt()\n\nfor prebuilts and\n\n  !module.IsReplacedByPrebuilt()\n\nfor sources, I believe. They should work just the same also when there are no duplicates, so no need to wait until a dupe is detected.",
      "parentUuid": "f59f858a_38eb78cc",
      "revId": "720ed452346bc92bd82e3d3c1c6def453e1928d6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ce868f11_d65a0c43",
        "filename": "java/boot_jars.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 75,
