      "writtenOn": "2021-01-18T18:18:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Very well, I\u0027ll try replacing IsHideFromMake with prebuilt-specific checks then, and add the same condition to the VisitAllModules lambda in updatableBcpPackagesRule.",
      "parentUuid": "ce868f11_d65a0c43",
      "revId": "720ed452346bc92bd82e3d3c1c6def453e1928d6",
